                  <nc xml:id="m-61b3918f-6895-4fb0-a58b-fca58910cffd" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-aa2d2181-2bff-4b19-974f-389773c8cdfa" facs="#m-45d34e77-5d88-42a3-a0d8-8d83067f652f" pname="b" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-766bf17b-1678-4b14-99d6-f0f4e6c339e1"><lg xml:id="m-889cebd7-729a-41c0-9644-3e3f6ecd9d04"><l xml:id="m-e136629b-f3ff-4441-8f95-f66a6405f8ec" facs="#m-d72bccdd-4641-4a53-8c74-9e1a01a48c19" label="ambiguous">1e00</l><l xml:id="m-eef99f8e-3963-4099-ad39-2f24b65f8577" facs="#m-7739ff5f-9856-4a5c-867c-6f9cc029604b" label="ambiguous">August 15.</l><l xml:id="m-0ca5d399-ae52-4778-bfa9-924d7843582a" facs="#m-ff4cfb6d-b713-4330-8036-72880ba318ac" label="ambiguous">nonoue unene ne nao</l><l xml:id="m-a7b21f06-bfa0-4355-b77e-c0522472f38a" facs="#m-2fe13ae8-66ac-470c-97ef-d40c93595f53" label="ambiguous">AUGUST. 15</l><l xml:id="m-adf523eb-ec8f-40c5-bae2-8de4310bef82" facs="#m-62c7d068-a374-461e-9831-bce738c90c48" label="text-like">THE ASSUMPTION</l><l xml:id="m-c6419aa7-6fb7-4d12-9792-78c160b04e5f" facs="#m-eaa64d2d-4dd3-418e-8f2a-e03c42f50ace" label="text-like">OF THE BLESSED VIRGIN MARY.</l><l xml:id="m-1d7a8c85-aa3c-44c6-ba1f-95ebedaaf264" facs="#m-9799c7fb-5f0e-4256-b98d-f6b464b76c3f" label="text-like">Double of the first Class with common Octave.</l><l xml:id="m-686165fa-039d-4119-92ec-77103c8ec0b9" facs="#m-de6aef35-6d2f-48e4-a0aa-ed1e90ff608f" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-7f65b433-c2e7-49a6-834c-ffbfcddc9577" facs="#m-027be61d-82fc-4a9c-b0f3-0e97aa0e9db8" label="text-like">Antiphons, Psalms and Chapter all as at second Vespers, p. 1605.</l><l xml:id="m-ca362e34-fd30-45ab-b19a-c0ebbd00b4cc" facs="#m-ff167930-0ec8-46d1-ad04-930889fe9c02" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-6f8f0a1a-757d-4265-a75a-8f0dfae1586e" facs="#m-84ea6c7d-1d79-4eba-ba9f-ad857ca07199" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-390dbd13-e8a8-42be-9261-b4507169b8e0" facs="#m-be05d97e-fc5f-4f6d-aab8-05437b3b51d8" label="lyrics-like">UPríma, Vírgo, pró-di-ta</l><l xml:id="m-96bb9ce0-fe76-42c0-8c5f-3d9c6685497e" facs="#m-2d98ad51-9a62-4629-a924-c2375e931eea" label="lyrics-like">E Condi-tó-ris spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa47f4d2-6980-4f4a-b765-b723fe134730" facs="#m-a7747e95-6141-4720-82f2-7a2169f38026" label="lyrics-like">Gestáre in álvo Fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ecf65c59-2916-441d-8ff6-2750247c05b7" facs="#m-f44fb90d-0839-4d28-92e7-9139043c97bf" label="lyrics-like">ri-tu, Praedestináta Al-tis-simi</l><l xml:id="m-a6cae9f1-01ae-4a09-a0d0-260dc786bf89" facs="#m-0ebed011-4325-441d-b875-29c3aafc4a4c" label="lyrics-like">li-um. 2. Tu pérpes hóstis fémina Praenunti-a-ta daémo¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb7d10f5-fb8c-4ae8-b177-15253499bec2" facs="#m-40050128-fc35-4f85-9ca6-d8d2b21731dc" label="lyrics-like">nis, Opplé-ris úna grá-ti-a</l><l xml:id="m-3722cc47-c815-47aa-a3c0-db9e010375c8" facs="#m-465f6d40-5f2b-4c2d-8f89-f43599422768" label="lyrics-like">Intami-náta o-ri-gine.</l><l xml:id="m-2cb69619-f32f-44d7-8984-e03ba9ae3fb4" facs="#m-bb5764d8-52fb-4436-bc54-e22d5961ff1f" label="lyrics-like">3. Tu véntre Vi-tam cónci-pis, Vi-támque ab Adam pér¬</l><l xml:id="m-579f9d9d-77dd-403f-a0ae-2350f4146bd9" facs="#m-65096d09-a29f-4a61-807f-f08496885be3" label="lyrics-like">Cárnem mi-nístrans</l><l xml:id="m-bbe5eb7c-876c-449a-ac98-c519f4edb582" facs="#m-074f09b6-bd5a-467a-bc92-677518f8aa2a" label="lyrics-like">di-tam, Di-ae li-tándae Vi-ctimae</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>